zcode-team-solve
A ZCode port of Memdoor's examples/workflows/team-solve.

This repository is a derivative work of Memdoor
(https://github.com/guregodevo/memdoor), Copyright 2026 Gregory Desvaux,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of that license is in
LICENSE.

Specifically derived:

  * .zcode/workflows/team-solve.dwf.ts carries the seven role prompts from
    Memdoor's examples/workflows/team-solve/steps/, with their wording held and
    only the file paths, the run identifier and the control flow adapted.
  * team-solve/check.py reimplements that directory's check-samples.sh in Python,
    with the same glob, comparison, diff and summary output.
  * team-solve/task.md and team-solve/tests/ are the sample shipped with it.

The method those prompts implement is described in the paper that Memdoor's
example cites (GVS5H, Lee, 2026).
